{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the quirky Alfred in this 3D adventure game. Explore the horrifyingly hostile alien mothership and attempt to escape your abductors. Having narrowly evaded a probing, Alfred must now avoid danger, solve interactive puzzles, and navigate the strange alien environment in what might be a futile effort to return home alive and <strong>unprobed</strong>!<br><br>The game features a range of thought provoking alien puzzles that you need to solve so that you can progress in your exploration of the alien mothership.\u00a0But that's not all, you must also jump, sprint and crawl your way through this dangerous alien environment as you never know what might be trying to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong>lfred's <strong>A</strong>lien <strong>A</strong>bduction <strong>A</strong>dventure \u2014 probably the only quadruple-\u2018A\u2019 game on the market today! <i>(joke)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although this game is a complete work of fiction, it has been heavily inspired by real life accounts of alien abduction. Most notably the case of <strong>Travis Walton</strong>, who was reportedly abducted while working near Snowflake, Arizona, on <strong>November 5th, 1975</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travis, if you happen to be reading this \u2014 THANK YOU for sharing your story. Without you and others like you, this game might never have been made. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065580/extras/b7a7077e1d851b5c7ef8ada7fbaaf0be.avif?t=1769437932\" width=250 height=374 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065580?t=1769437932","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065580?t=1769437932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam